</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/73f656b6-7d77-11f1-abdf-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/jude-bellingham.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/73f656b6-7d77-11f1-abdf-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/jude-bellingham.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">b40ddc2c-7d74-11f1-8f88-5713c269860a</guid><pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 23:52:31 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/73f656b6-7d77-11f1-abdf-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/jude-bellingham.jpg">© AFP - PATRICIA DE MELO MOREIRA </source><dc:creator>Paul Myers</dc:creator></item><item><category>Sports</category><title>African results justify World Cup slots increase amid criticism</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/sports/20260711-african-results-justify-world-cup-slots-increase-amid-criticism</link><description>
