</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/43e3e7d2-7cfe-11f1-99d3-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/be55411e7e2fcd9ccbc5f96ed0fe432ab2e3b214.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/43e3e7d2-7cfe-11f1-99d3-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/be55411e7e2fcd9ccbc5f96ed0fe432ab2e3b214.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">44d7ced8-7cfe-11f1-afb8-a7125e438b74</guid><pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 07:58:13 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/43e3e7d2-7cfe-11f1-99d3-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/be55411e7e2fcd9ccbc5f96ed0fe432ab2e3b214.jpg">© Odd ANDERSEN / AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>Sports</category><title>England and Norway bosses hail World Cup wonders Haaland and Kane</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/sports/20260711-england-and-norway-bosses-hail-world-cup-wonders-haaland-and-kane-world-cup-2026</link><description>
